@version: "1.0"

---[ Run ]---------------------------------------------------------------------
Mode                : "profile"
Duration            : 100ms
Threads             : 2
Warmup Samples      : 0
Samples             : 1
Minimum Sample Time : 50us
Memory Limit        : 8 MiB
Progress Interval   : 20ms
